X:1
T:Nocturne Op. 15 No. 3
C:Frédéric Chopin
O:Nocturne in G minor, Op. 15 No. 3
N:The opening theme (12 bars), with its first answer. The later returns and the
N:chorale section are left out. Transposed down a fourth from G minor to D minor,
N:so the lowest note is C4 and the highest D5. Notes from two Humdrum first-edition
N:encodings (ifdo.ca, kern2abc) that agree. The last bar stops after two beats,
N:where the next pass's pickup comes in. Chords simplified from the left hand.
M:3/4
Q:1/4=88
L:1/8
K:Dm
